  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Resourceful_Lib/BH_NU_HEADER.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"284\"></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Resourceful_Lib/BH_NU_BANNER1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"142\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">Resourceful Lib 是一個由 Team Resourceful 開發的模組庫，內含多種實用工具與 API。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">在撰寫此說明時，已有數款模組使用此函式庫，包括 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/resourceful-bees\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Resourceful Bees</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cozy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cozy</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vitalize\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vitalize</a> 以及更多模組！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Resourceful_Lib/BH_NU_BANNER2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"144\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 📺 GL Scissor API</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 📝 狀態化與歷史畫面管理器</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 📠&nbsp; 用於謂詞、標籤、合成配方、集合與隨機集合的編解碼器</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🎨 顏色 API</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🌐 跨平台網路連線</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 📲 Codec 合成配方</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 📁 JSON 檔案工具</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 💾 記憶體資源與資料包</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🎲 隨機集合/清單</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ⌛&nbsp; 排程 API</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🌎 網頁工具</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 📑 YABN（另一種二進位表示法）是一種壓縮的 JSON 二進位格式，可用於縮小 JSON 物件的傳輸大小</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 📐 高亮 API（自訂選擇框，不受方塊限制）</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/resourcefulbees\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Resourceful_Lib/BH_NU_BANNER3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"144\"></span></span></a></span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fteamresourceful\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Resourceful_Lib/BH_NU_PROMO.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"362\"></a></p>",
